;; first footman lies dead, and the burglar has the countess's jewels; the cook
;; is knocked out in the kitchen and comes to within the hour; the
;; under-gardener is tied up in the potting shed, away from his routine.
;; Test-owned: don't sync it with any bundled scenario.
